OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds pack meeting about
OL,4,Aharbour water quality
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of residents packed a public
OL,7,Fmeeting about harbour water quality
OL,8,Fafter a sudden spike in E. coli levels
OL,9,Fin a nearby river.
OL,11,FRegular testing of the River Stour in
OL,12,FChristchurch, Dorset, by Christchurch
OL,13,FHarbour and Marine Society (CHAMS)
OL,14,Frevealed a huge jump in bacteria levels
OL,15,Fin mid-August.
OL,17,FThe Environment Agency (EA) said it had
OL,18,Fnot been able to identify the source of
OL,19,Fthe spike and subsequent sampling found
OL,20,FE. coli levels to be "within the range
OL,21,Fwe would expect".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
