OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds pack meeting about
OL,4,Aharbour water quality
OL,5,
OL,6,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,7,FCouncil (BCP), which hosted Tuesday's
OL,8,Fmeeting, said it backed community
OL,9,Fefforts to make the harbour a
OL,10,Fdesignated bathing area, requiring the
OL,11,FEA to monitor water quality from May to
OL,12,FSeptember.
